[320.359766, "o", "    but probably with a different calibration strategy.\r\n    Therefore, I will not load the fits-idi files again and keep the old MS.\r\nDone\r\n\r\n\r\nSaving initial flag version to\r\n  VLBI_C.ms.flagversions/flags.init_flagversion ...\r\n"]
