[321.057245, "o", "Warning: No ANTAB table found for gain curve conversion.\r\nGain curve calibration will fail.\r\n\r\n"]
[321.057676, "o", "\r\nThe pipeline will execute the following steps for the\r\n"]
[321.057706, "o", "VLBA array in the given order:\r\n   a : load models of observed sources (if present)\r\n   b : use online flags from idi files (if present)\r\n   c : use flags from metadata (if present)\r\n   d : flag based on outlier detection from auto-correlations vs time\r\n"]
[321.05773, "o", "   e : flag based on outlier detection from auto-correlations vs frequency\r\n   f : flag edge channels\r\n"]
[321.057869, "o", "   g : flag start and end segments of scans (quacking)\r\n   0 : task_accor\r\n   1 : task_scalar_bandpass\r\n   2 : task_tsys\r\n   3 : task_gaincurve\r\n"]
[321.057918, "o", "   4 : task_ionospheric_tec_map\r\n   5 : task_fringefit_single\r\n   6 : task_fringefit_solint_cal\r\n   7 : task_fringefit_multi_cal_short\r\n   8 : task_complex_bandpass\r\n   9 : task_rldelay\r\n  10 : task_rlphase\r\n  11 : task_dterms\r\n  12 : task_fringefit_multi_sci_long\r\n  13 : task_fringefit_solint_sci\r\n  14 : task_fringefit_multi_sci_short\r\n   h : clear the calibrated data column of the MS from previous applycal runs\r\n   i : apply all existing tables from all_calibration_steps\r\n   j : print overview of flagged data (can be slow)\r\n   k : make diagnostic plots of calibrated visibilities and create a calibration summary file\r\n   l : average and export the calibrated data\r\nCan use quickmode [-q] to execute only a subset of these steps.\r\n\r\n\r\n          -- Executing step a --\r\n\r\nLoading model data for the observed sources...\r\n"]
[321.067633, "o", "  No models found. Continuing.\r\nDone\r\n\r\n          -- Executing step b --\r\n"]
[321.06781, "o", "\r\nGetting flags from fits-idi files...\r\n  No files found. Continuing.\r\nDone\r\n"]
[321.067836, "o", "\r\n          -- Executing step c --\r\n\r\nLooking for metadata files with flagging information...\r\n"]
